title: ADCS ESC8 Web Enrollment NTLM Relay
id: 8c231c48-e319-4bcc-9e30-b99a29d2ea4c
status: experimental
description: Detects certificate enrollment via the ADCS web enrollment endpoint (certsrv) authenticated with a machine account over NTLM, the ESC8 technique that relays coerced authentication to mint certificates for a victim.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1649/
logsource:
  category: webserver
detection:
  selection:
    cs-uri-stem|contains: '/certsrv/'
    cs-username|endswith: '$'
    cs-auth-method: 'NTLM'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-username
  - c-ip
  - cs-uri-stem
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate machine enrollment
level: critical
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1649
